This directory contains a research reconstruction of Future Crew's Panic,
based on reverse engineering and comparisons with original machine code.
It is not represented as a clean-room implementation or cleared public release.

The repository's MIT license does not apply to this directory or to the full
import/recovery helpers tools/import_panic.py and tools/unpack_panic.py.
No additional license over Future Crew material is asserted. Public
redistribution of the reconstructed implementation remains under review.

Original assets, unpacked executables and binary test fixtures are not included.
They must be supplied or derived locally under the applicable original terms.
Dependency licenses remain with their respective authors; dependencies are
referenced through Cargo rather than vendored into this source tree.
